<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Tesla returns six weeks after starting sertraline 50 mg. He has had no side effects since the first week and has missed no doses. He has had five ERP sessions and has practiced touching door handles without washing for ten minutes, and eating lunch without calculating its volume on two days a week. He washes about 30 times a day. Counting his steps is still hard to resist, and repeating laboratory steps in threes still costs him about two hours a day. He saw the dietitian and now eats three meals on most days. He sleeps about five hours. He has had no suicidal thoughts. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Washing down to about 30 times a day; two meals a week without calculating</td></tr><tr><td>Psychotherapy</td><td>Five ERP sessions with homework</td></tr><tr><td>Rituals</td><td>About two hours a day of counting and repeating</td></tr><tr><td>Nutrition</td><td>Dietitian seen; three meals most days</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No suicidal thoughts</td></tr><tr><td>Y-BOCS</td><td>24, down from 28</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

